{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Player": 12,
    "「少女」": 51,
    "派蒙": 26
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7605201",
      "subQuestName": "同「少女」见面",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760520101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760520101": {
            "id": "760520101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520102"
            ]
          },
          "760520102": {
            "id": "760520102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哥伦比娅，你还好吗？看上去有点没精打采呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520103"
            ]
          },
          "760520103": {
            "id": "760520103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "是你们啊。我没事…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520104"
            ]
          },
          "760520104": {
            "id": "760520104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（是又在思考关于「月亮」的问题了吗…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520105"
            ]
          },
          "760520105": {
            "id": "760520105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "有什么能为你做的吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520106"
            ]
          },
          "760520106": {
            "id": "760520106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520107"
            ]
          },
          "760520107": {
            "id": "760520107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520108"
            ]
          },
          "760520108": {
            "id": "760520108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "没关系，就算只是些小烦恼，说出来也会好些哦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520109"
            ]
          },
          "760520109": {
            "id": "760520109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我有点…想喝酒馆里的饮品。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520110"
            ]
          },
          "760520110": {
            "id": "760520110",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520111"
            ]
          },
          "760520111": {
            "id": "760520111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "…唔。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520112"
            ]
          },
          "760520112": {
            "id": "760520112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "抱歉！刚才我有点惊讶。因为你很少会提你自己想要什么东西嘛…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520113"
            ]
          },
          "760520113": {
            "id": "760520113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "而且，居然只是…饮品。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520114"
            ]
          },
          "760520114": {
            "id": "760520114",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "是觉得太简单了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520115"
            ]
          },
          "760520115": {
            "id": "760520115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "可能我以为至少也得是「为我摘下月亮吧」这种级别的愿望…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520116"
            ]
          },
          "760520116": {
            "id": "760520116",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，不过我似乎可以理解。现在哥伦比娅无法随心所欲地行动，去酒馆说不定和摘月亮差不多难呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520117"
            ]
          },
          "760520117": {
            "id": "760520117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "不只是现在。以前在「愚人众」的时候没人要抓我，但出门散步的时候，大家还是躲得远远的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520118"
            ]
          },
          "760520118": {
            "id": "760520118",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（执行官第三席…这个名号的确会让不了解她的人害怕吧…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520119"
            ]
          },
          "760520119": {
            "id": "760520119",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "咦？不过…我突然觉得这愿望也不是那么难！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520120"
            ]
          },
          "760520120": {
            "id": "760520120",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#只要求酒馆水平的饮品的话，{NICKNAME}，你不是就会做嘛！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520121"
            ]
          },
          "760520121": {
            "id": "760520121",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "…真的？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520122"
            ]
          },
          "760520122": {
            "id": "760520122",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "看你那么期待的样子，我反倒要紧张起来了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520123"
            ]
          },
          "760520123": {
            "id": "760520123",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "口味上有要求吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520124"
            ]
          },
          "760520124": {
            "id": "760520124",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "口味…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520125"
            ]
          },
          "760520125": {
            "id": "760520125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我没怎么尝试过外面的饮品，反而给不出具体的方向…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520126"
            ]
          },
          "760520126": {
            "id": "760520126",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "不要太厚重的？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520127"
            ]
          },
          "760520127": {
            "id": "760520127",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "厚重是什么意思？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520128"
            ]
          },
          "760520128": {
            "id": "760520128",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "像「愚人众」的大衣一样。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520129"
            ]
          },
          "760520129": {
            "id": "760520129",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎么越比喻还越模糊了啊！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520132"
            ]
          },
          "760520132": {
            "id": "760520132",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "好啊。交给你定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7605202",
      "subQuestName": "调制饮品",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760520301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760520301": {
            "id": "760520301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "(test)调的还行吧，一般合我胃口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7605204",
      "subQuestName": "(test)隐藏$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760520401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760520401": {
            "id": "760520401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我闻过这个气味。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520402"
            ]
          },
          "760520402": {
            "id": "760520402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "噢？在哪里？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520403"
            ]
          },
          "760520403": {
            "id": "760520403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "桑多涅的房间。她看我好像对散发这种香味的饮品很感兴趣，故意拿在手上好半天都没喝完。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520404"
            ]
          },
          "760520404": {
            "id": "760520404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "就像…在等我提问一样。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520405"
            ]
          },
          "760520405": {
            "id": "760520405",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那你问了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520406"
            ]
          },
          "760520406": {
            "id": "760520406",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520407"
            ]
          },
          "760520407": {
            "id": "760520407",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "问的什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520408"
            ]
          },
          "760520408": {
            "id": "760520408",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "「你不应该喝机油吗？」",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520409"
            ]
          },
          "760520409": {
            "id": "760520409",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "她…怎么说？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520410"
            ]
          },
          "760520410": {
            "id": "760520410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520411"
            ]
          },
          "760520411": {
            "id": "760520411",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "很难听的话。不要学。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520412"
            ]
          },
          "760520412": {
            "id": "760520412",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520413"
            ]
          },
          "760520413": {
            "id": "760520413",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "才喝一口就不感兴趣了呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520414"
            ]
          },
          "760520414": {
            "id": "760520414",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "对不起，有点苦，不好喝。难怪桑多涅脸色那么难看。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520415"
            ]
          },
          "760520415": {
            "id": "760520415",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我觉得那个是因为别的原因…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7605205",
      "subQuestName": "(test)隐藏$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760520501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760520501": {
            "id": "760520501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "咕嘟…咕嘟…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520502"
            ]
          },
          "760520502": {
            "id": "760520502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "一口气全喝完了！太好了，她看起来是很喜欢的样子呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520503"
            ]
          },
          "760520503": {
            "id": "760520503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "没什么味道。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520504"
            ]
          },
          "760520504": {
            "id": "760520504",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "没…没什么味道？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520505"
            ]
          },
          "760520505": {
            "id": "760520505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520508"
            ]
          },
          "760520508": {
            "id": "760520508",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "噢，不用了，谢谢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520509"
            ]
          },
          "760520509": {
            "id": "760520509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "曾经，我无法理解人们所说的那种丰收的喜悦，直到有天，我亲手触碰了枝头成熟的果实…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520510"
            ]
          },
          "760520510": {
            "id": "760520510",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我能从果皮的纹理中感受到它的生命力，它将来自阳光、水土和空气的养分转化成了这种形式。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520511"
            ]
          },
          "760520511": {
            "id": "760520511",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "伴随着咀嚼时的脆响，鲜甜的滋味像沁凉白浪一般层层翻涌而来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520512"
            ]
          },
          "760520512": {
            "id": "760520512",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "于是我明白了，香气是一种谁也逃不开的引力。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520513"
            ]
          },
          "760520513": {
            "id": "760520513",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哦！不错的感想呢！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520514"
            ]
          },
          "760520514": {
            "id": "760520514",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我们以夺走这种生命力的方式完成了自然的转化。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520515"
            ]
          },
          "760520515": {
            "id": "760520515",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "突然就变得残酷了起来？！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520516"
            ]
          },
          "760520516": {
            "id": "760520516",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "所以我更喜欢新鲜的水果，它让我知道我从这个世界原原本本地取走了什么。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520517"
            ]
          },
          "760520517": {
            "id": "760520517",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "这也是我应当回报这个世界的…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7605206",
      "subQuestName": "(test)隐藏$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760520601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760520601": {
            "id": "760520601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "白灵果给你。慢慢嚼嚼看吧，很甜。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7605203",
      "subQuestName": "同「少女」对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760520201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760520201": {
            "id": "760520201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520202"
            ]
          },
          "760520202": {
            "id": "760520202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎么样怎么样？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520203"
            ]
          },
          "760520203": {
            "id": "760520203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "它让我回想起了非常久远的过去，那时我和「霜月之子」生活在一起…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520204"
            ]
          },
          "760520204": {
            "id": "760520204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "他们习惯将新鲜的薄荷叶、香料和浆果干共同冲泡，制成具有混合风味的饮品。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520205"
            ]
          },
          "760520205": {
            "id": "760520205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "每次经过窗边的时候，我总会闻见小屋里飘出淡淡的草木清香…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520206"
            ]
          },
          "760520206": {
            "id": "760520206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "后来呢？你尝了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520207"
            ]
          },
          "760520207": {
            "id": "760520207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "试过，但没喝成。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520208"
            ]
          },
          "760520208": {
            "id": "760520208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？为什么…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520209"
            ]
          },
          "760520209": {
            "id": "760520209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "「神明大人」突然说出「能尝尝你家的茶吗？」这种话之后…没人敢真的将家中的「粗茶」献上…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520210"
            ]
          },
          "760520210": {
            "id": "760520210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，也是呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520211"
            ]
          },
          "760520211": {
            "id": "760520211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "最后到我手中，就变成了在华美包装下「献予神明」的「贡品」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520212"
            ]
          },
          "760520212": {
            "id": "760520212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "不是说它难喝。但…它少了某种我路过窗边时闻到的…温馨的味道。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520213"
            ]
          },
          "760520213": {
            "id": "760520213",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "现在可以喝个够了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520214"
            ]
          },
          "760520214": {
            "id": "760520214",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯…",
            "nextDialogs": [
